Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU desktop meta package
 Meta package for the StrawWU desktop environment. Replaces
 ubuntu-desktop for new installs: no snapd, apport, whoopsie,
 ubuntu-report, or ubuntu-pro-client in Depends/Recommends.
 Interim session uses GNOME Shell until strawwu-shell (W4-D2).
